* PTM bulk CMOS model library for ngspice (180nm..22nm)
* Usage: .lib "<path>/ptm.lib" <section>   devices: nch / pch, drawn L = node
* sections: n180 n130 n90 n65 (bulk) | n45hp n45lp n32hp n32lp n22hp n22lp (metal gate/high-k)

.lib n180
